  "ID": "62758",
  "post_title": "Unas 90 personas participan en la X marcha senderista de Ribesalbes",
  "post_date": "2016-04-19 18:43:32",
  "post_name": "unas-90-personas-participan-en-la-x-marcha-senderista-de-ribesalbes",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Deportes|Medio ambiente|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/IMG_9930.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(85 fotos) Unas 90 personas han participado este s&aacute;bado, 16 de abril, en la X marcha senderista de Ribesalbes, en la que se ten&iacute;an que completar unos 15 km de caminos y sendas de dificultad media en 4 horas, aproximadamente.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/IMG_9925.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La inscripci&oacute;n costaba 12 euros y el Ayuntamiento obsequiaba a las personas participantes, antes de salir, con una camiseta y una botellita de agua.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/IMG_9960.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La marcha se ha iniciado hacia las 8.30 horas desde el Ayuntamiento de Ribesalbes para cruzar por el puente de un caudaloso r&iacute;o Mijares</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/IMG_9977.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>hacia Chabalasar y vuelta a Ribesalbes.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/DinarMarxaSenderistaRibesalbes.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 318px;\" /></p>\n<p>Al final ha habido una comida en el Centro Cultural y Recreatrivo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9916.jpg\" alt=\"img_9916\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9918.jpg\" alt=\"img_9918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9919.jpg\" alt=\"img_9919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9920.jpg\" alt=\"img_9920\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9922.jpg\" alt=\"img_9922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9923.jpg\" alt=\"img_9923\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9925.jpg\" alt=\"img_9925\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9926.jpg\" alt=\"img_9926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9930.jpg\" alt=\"img_9930\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9931.jpg\" alt=\"img_9931\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9934.jpg\" alt=\"img_9934\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9935.jpg\" alt=\"img_9935\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9937.jpg\" alt=\"img_9937\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9938.jpg\" alt=\"img_9938\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasenderistaribesalbesx160416/img_9939.jpg\" alt